        ['q' => 'Which building codes has San Antonio adopted?', 'a' => '<p>On January 30, 2025, the San Antonio City Council adopted the 2024 editions of the International Building Code, International Residential Code, International Existing Building Code, and other ICC codes, along with the 2021 International Energy Conservation Code and the 2023 National Electrical Code, with local amendments (Ord. No. 2025-01-30-0075). The city\'s Chapter 10 building-related codes document lists an effective date of May 1, 2025. Confirm current requirements with the Development Services Department.</p>'],
